    <node id="Anvers">
      <data key="d0">Anvers</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Anvers is a substation that contains multiple busbar sections at voltage level 220.0 operating at a nominal voltage of 225 kV.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;Anvers is a station that operates at a nominal voltage of 225 kV and corresponds to topological node BE-Busbar_2.&lt;SEP&gt;Anvers is a substation that contains the energy consumer L-1230804819 at voltage level 220.0.</data>
